WEBVTT

00:00:59.556 --> 00:01:00.724
NW: Absolutely.

00:01:00.757 --> 00:01:06.096
I believe that grief can take
so many different forms,

00:01:06.129 --> 00:01:09.633
and I think oftentimes
when we think about grief,

00:01:09.666 --> 00:01:14.404
we associate it with the emotional process

00:01:14.438 --> 00:01:18.075
that takes place when we're coping
with the death of a loved one.

00:01:18.108 --> 00:01:19.309
I don't know.

00:01:19.343 --> 00:01:22.613
It's just not as common to associate grief

00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:25.415
or correlate grief
with the loss of a dream.

00:01:25.449 --> 00:01:29.653
So when you think about dreams
and when they begin

00:01:29.686 --> 00:01:35.292
and how deeply they're rooted
into our daily lives and our routines